## Commission

| Layer | Where | Rule |
|-------|-------|------|
| Gate | `SharedAdjacencyMatrix::eval_alpha()` | `f = 1 - kFeeBps×1e-4` (15 bps round-trip) on full 3-leg product |
| CW | buy-anchor | `(1/a₀)×b₁×b₂×f` |
| CCW | sell-anchor | `(1/a₂)×(1/a₁)×b₀×f` |
| Wire | `size_burst` / `TradeWs::Send` | No fee on qty — must flag if claiming inventory-neutral |
| Test | `tests/trade_send_test.cpp` | Sell qty = `floor(executed×0.999, step)` — 10 bps haircut |

Align fee model across eval, sizing, and test before live.

