## LOT_SIZE + NOTIONAL

**Active triangle** — read at preflight time, do not hardcode pairs:

| Source | Use |
|--------|-----|
| `cfg::SYMBOLS[i]` | `name` · `stepSize` for each matrix index `i` |
| `Config.Ticker[i]` | wire symbol sent to `TradeWs` |
| `docs/BinanceFilters.md` or `exchangeInfo` | cross-check `stepSize` · `minQty` · `minNotional` per pair |

| Filter | Rule |
|--------|------|
| `stepSize` | `qty = floor(q / stepSize) × stepSize` per leg |
| `minQty` | floored qty ≥ pair `minQty` (often equals `stepSize`) |
| `minNotional` | `qty × book_price ≥ minNotional` in **quote asset** of that pair |

| Filter | Engine | Test |
|--------|--------|------|
| step floor | `size_burst` per `cfg::SYMBOLS[i].stepSize` | offline floor cases + live round-trip per active pair |
| minNotional | leg 0 seed at `maxNotionalQty` only | bumps until buy **and** post-fee sell clear min per pair |
| qty wire | `TradeWs` `%.8f` all symbols | step-aware floor before send |

**Preflight per leg** — for each hop `i` in the fired burst, using live `bid(i)` / `ask(i)`:

```text
notional_i = qty_i × price_i   # price = ask on BUY, bid on SELL
fail if notional_i < minNotional_i (typically 5 in quote)
```

After `size_burst`, downstream legs often sit **below** minNotional when `maxNotionalQty` is small → `-1013 NOTIONAL` risk on fire.

